<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-18T11:28:01.054Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:28:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;RSF drones have struck a market in Nyala, killing at least 30 civilians, and have attacked an artisanal gold mine in South Kordofan, while the Sudanese army has carried out a drone strike that killed four civilians in West Kordofan and claims to have killed dozens of RSF fighters in a separate Nyala attack. An ammunition depot explosion in northern Khartoum caused panic and damaged homes. Al-Burhan sent a message to the German chancellor urging peace efforts, invited the African Human Rights Commission, and warned against continued RSF support. UN officials are demanding an immediate halt to drone strikes in Sudan. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168612&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE1DdVo0cVRncXRWb0Q0Y3dvM0QxZEtFZGd4eFQwRUQwTllWZDBjZ0FYMkpHdGNKNUw3ZnZkRnoxOFVZUWdFU3N2T0JpOWV4TUpKVE5RVDFRWnlEZ9IBX0FVX3lxTE84YkRGMTBGYkdwNmszTGJnMURCN1pCZTJOWHYyTGFVQ21JbHdyQnVSUE5OMS1ySHJMSTJlYmhnaFFQV2xDcXNiNE9SUndNUDZuRk01TXRQaURHRmVET2pJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxNOXNWb3ZxRy1JSVN4TnRMc0xuQmtHZ2ZVSFFWVXZfMnpHQTZjUFBfRkxNTU5ZanM2ZGxSRmM1Q2M1al9rdkV5Qnk4MUZDT1l5bk5UNVpSM21oRUlkZ2Y4SkMyS2ljcHZBVHA1ZG4zeVBzS01DQVpuN3pPdjVRMVdaTGJiM3JpQUl0dVBGUXM0Q3lWS05UREs1WFVDa2ZFcmpWbHhiSElxZWgwS05DWWl0bDFieXNzUkpoQU9VdXJZbUVsamlkVllv?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNV1cxMFdrYmJ2Z0x3ZzRXc2pCblVRdmJuZHIyQTVnVnFRNV96ejZtQWRFLXMzTTA3ZUFneUV2WjZfbXZzVGNuS2QxdndSVm9URnRaY0NtVldLQ3BjaW1fQ1lFQWZVWERhU1dmam9mMWJzWm55RGR0c0YtT1NnWTNtQmxBNGFCTXR6Rk03UTlrV29QajhB?oc=5&quot